# Lottie animation JSON files go here.
# Required files:
#   sticker_burst.json    — Particle burst on sticker tap (8 emoji, 0.5s, 60fps)
#   orbit_ring.json       — Orbit ring pulse animation
#   empty_state.json      — Empty feed / no results illustration
#   success_check.json    — Payment / verification success checkmark
#   tip_sent.json         — Tip sent celebration animation
#   orbit_confirmed.json  — Orbit mutual pull confirmed animation
#   voice_recording.json  — Live waveform recording animation
#   call_connecting.json  — Call connecting spinner animation
#
# Export from After Effects using the Bodymovin plugin.
# Target: 60fps, dimensions 400×400px, transparent background.
